{
  "bookId": "rewind-11",
  "id": "chapter-48",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称；|102|＝按玩家性别变化的称谓；|103|＝按玩家性别变化的敬称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "6720001",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "12:10，家中的桌面上，巨大分贝警报声响起的瞬间，紧闭的玻璃窗被震的粉碎。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6720002",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "主人不见了！什么时候不见了的！快，快找到主人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6720003",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "警报器的声音太吵了，我无法行动。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6720004",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "不可以，谁都不可以带走主人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6720005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "警报声……停了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6720006",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "警报我已经解除危机了，你们都起来。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6720007",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "主人，主人，你在哪里？快，谁来帮我把门打开。我……我出不去。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6720008",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "都冷静。对方只是手办，不可能会对人类造成伤害。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6720009",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "不，警察小姐，请你一定要帮帮我们。帮我们把主人救回来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6720010",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "不管你知道什么，请你告诉我们吧。我所有的涂料都给你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6720011",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "优纪……警察小姐，对不起，我们之前对你态度不好，请你帮帮我们吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6720012",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "奇怪，明明只是手办，到底是怎样将人类偷走的呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6720013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "请你帮帮我们。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6720014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "我是警察，我自然会抓到犯人。现在都安静，让我整理一下信息。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6720015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "救命……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6720016",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "救命……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6720017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "窗外的声音，是主人的求救声！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6720018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "就在附近。大家快，一起把窗子打破！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6720019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "都冷静，这件事情太古怪了。对方明明只是一个手办！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6720020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "对不起警察小姐，我们无法像你这样冷静，那是我们的主人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6720021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "加大力度，玻璃窗快被打破了。还差一点。成功了！追——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6720022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "等等！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725001",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "12:15，爱猫社区，沿着你的求救声一路狂追不舍的手办跳下窗子，来到室外。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725002",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "救我……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "那边。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "箱子？这么大的箱子？悬在了空中？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725005",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "主人在箱子里！主人的声音听上去很痛苦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725007",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "的确，就如那个警察所说。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725008",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "刚刚明明好端端地坐在家里。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725009",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "为什么会一瞬间消失不见。一瞬间又被关进悬空的木箱里！",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725010",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "手办到底是……如何将人类瞬间运输到上面去的。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725011",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你是谁？啊——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725012",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "不行，我现在已经无法冷静思考了。\n我要相信主人，主人|102|可是……一个坚不可摧的人类啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "你看上去要哭了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "是你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "怎么跑不动了吗？如果继续按照这个速度追，你们会距离空中那个移动中的箱子越来越远。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725016",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "不！我们不会跟丢的。和江，我还能跑得更快。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "嗯，我也可以。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "加速了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725019",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "我当然知道该怎么做。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725020",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "我会追上她、他、它们的。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725021",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "不论是谁，敢把如此玩弄主人，我都会杀了它。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和江……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "这份滋味，我会付诸在。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6725024",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "任何一个，伤害|102|的人之上！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
