      "title": "本能理论·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "6745001",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "爱猫社区，手办追逐着悬空的木箱。即使敌人肆意从箱子跳下围攻，也无法它们阻挡一步。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745002",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "哪里不对。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745003",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "究竟哪里不对。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745004",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "悬空……的纸箱吗？",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745005",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "设备投影抑或视觉假象？发生在强光照的白天。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745006",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "所以，我们的确在追逐真实的箱子。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745007",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "而并非一个幻觉或是影像。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745008",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "悬空？细线垂钓或是牵引？",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745009",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "强风扇？磁力？",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745010",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "4层楼的高度，40英尺，四周空无一物，假设推翻重构。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745011",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "箱子里面有什么？",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745012",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "被抓起来的，约莫50kg的人类？",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745013",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "|102|是手办的主人，被怎样的手法抓进去？且瞒过我的眼睛。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745014",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "或者根本没有，里面空无一物？",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745015",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "甚至充满了飘浮状的物体？",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745016",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "是气球吗？轻易提供骗过眼睛的浮力。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745017",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "但它在移动，因为它被某个事物牵引。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745018",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "飞行的事物吗？道具、鸟，还是玩具。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745019",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "这重要吗？或许很重要，或许不重要。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745020",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "飞行的道具想要制造什么？一个从外表看上去不可思议的悬浮木箱。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745021",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "它不想被看到，是角度吗？",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745022",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "仰视的盲角，手办天然的比例。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745023",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "为什么不想被看到，因为它丑陋，亦或者担心、害怕？",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745024",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "被看到会传达信息，信息会揭露真相。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745025",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "真相会让让我们停驻脚步。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745026",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "停驻脚步之后怎样？不再追逐。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745027",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "因为追逐会拉长距离，跟谁拉长距离？",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745028",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "【|101|】",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745029",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "是那个人类。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745030",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "谁在乎那个人类？",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745031",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "那个窃贼，怪盗，她想要偷走|102|。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745032",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "此刻现在。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6745033",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "思考到行动前后不超过一秒，一抹绿色的暗影略过，将几欲失去理智的手办阻拦得瘫倒在地上。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-308",
