      "title": "本能理论·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "6805001",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "爱猫社区，柴可夫斯鸡集群由于群龙无首很快四散离去，手办们在急速地狂奔之中已经十分接近家的地点。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805002",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "落在地上的圆镜、胡须，变装外套。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805003",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "她在主动地周旋。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805004",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "故意暴露给我看吗？",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805005",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "在试图传达什么信息？",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805006",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "胜利的挑衅？",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805007",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "已经成功抓到了，名为【|101|】的人类吗？",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805008",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "不，我要二次确认。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805009",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "这一次不再使用眼睛和耳朵。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805010",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "而是切实地触碰，感知。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805011",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "我会让虚妄无从遁形。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805012",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "信号尝试接入。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805013",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "主动联络的权限？谁颁布的密匙准许？",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805014",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "这帮家伙还不清楚吗？单方向的贸然的联络有时候会葬送我的性命。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805015",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "允许。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805016",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "调查12:00截至目前途经或接近爱猫社区坐标386.426的所有载客、乘用车辆。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805017",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "目标确定。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805018",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "储存物料单元移动集装设备，与目标【|101|】触达率，100%",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805019",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "触达时间：12:30，汽车品牌：FULI物流。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805020",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "无法施展子局部破坏。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805021",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "无法施展子局部破坏。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805022",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "已将【|101|】抓捕到手。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805023",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "并尝试通过物流设备实施转移吗？",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805024",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "连接终止。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6805025",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "单方向强制断开。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6810001",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "爱猫社区，家方圆1米。一辆物流车正执行点火装置，即将启动。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6810002",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "物流车上装有可容纳成人大小的木箱。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6810003",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "那辆卡车！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6810004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "我们兵分两路进行。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6810005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "我前往运载工具进行调查。\n你们三人负责折返回家进行针对【|101|】目标的二次存在确认。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6810006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "明白吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6810007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "好，交给我！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6810008",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "毫无征兆之下，物流车上装载的木箱突然内突然传来【|101|】的呼喊。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6810009",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "救命！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6810010",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "救命啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6810011",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "主人的声音！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6810012",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "车辆……启动了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6810013",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "凛在第一时间朝卡车尾部抛出匕首钩锁。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6810014",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "和江、优纪与花迦本能反应下抓住了凛的身体。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6810015",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "在物流车的疾驰之下，钩锁上的手办在空中剧烈地上下晃动，急速前进。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6815001",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "晚间5:00，物流卡车疾驰在郊野。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6815002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "光是沿着铁索攀爬上来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6815003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "身体就已经接近极限了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6815004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "好大的风。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6815005",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "抓紧我！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6815006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "【|101|】！【|101|】！你在箱子里吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6815007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "为什么你不回答优纪……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6815008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "呜呜，你是不是死了，是不是死了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6815009",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哇啊啊啊啊啊——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6815010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "抓到你了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6815011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "要殉情吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6815012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "真是羡慕你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6815013",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "不会吧！【|101|】|103|可是好端端地待在人家的箱子里呢。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6815014",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "？",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6820001",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "好不容易才生擒的猎物。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6820002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "怎么忍心让|102|就如此轻易地……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "6820003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "死掉呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
